{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778533279224,"sessionID":"ses_1e72c9a66ffepiGuNQMZw6iNCY","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-bb771466bd5591f6","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"__issue_context__.json"},"output":"<path>/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/__issue_context__.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"body\": \"This is a self-assigned issue I am opening to add non-human animal diseases from VeNom. \\r\\n\\r\\nSee https://venomcoding.org/venom-codes/\\r\\n\\r\\nThere are 6,182 rows of diagnosis data with disease/phenotype name, VeNom code, body system classification (if applicable), and group of animal affected (large animal, small animal, farm animal, equine, exotics). \\r\\n\\r\\nThis data will need curation as some \\\"diagnoses\\\" are actually \\\"phenotypes\\\" and should be added to uPheno. \\r\\n\\r\\nThe non-human animal diseases will be mapped to human disease analogs as appropriate. \",\n3:   \"comments\": [\n4:     {\n5:       \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach85TUWn4\",\n6:       \"author\": {\n7:         \"login\": \"nicolevasilevsky\"\n8:       },\n9:       \"authorAssociation\": \"MEMBER\",\n10:       \"body\": \"@katiermullen could you assign this to a milestone? (You can always push it back later)\",\n11:       \"createdAt\": \"2023-01-20T02:16:22Z\",\n12:       \"includesCreatedEdit\": true,\n13:       \"isMinimized\": false,\n14:       \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n15:       \"reactionGroups\": [],\n16:       \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/5726#issuecomment-1397844472\",\n17:       \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n18:     },\n19:     {\n20:       \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach872t2c4\",\n21:       \"author\": {\n22:         \"login\": \"katiermullen\"\n23:       },\n24:       \"authorAssociation\": \"MEMBER\",\n25:       \"body\": \"Add venom non-human animal disease x-refs from VeNom_release_h_Feb_2026\",\n26:       \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-27T00:32:08Z\",\n27:       \"includesCreatedEdit\": false,\n28:       \"isMinimized\": false,\n29:       \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n30:       \"reactionGroups\": [],\n31:       \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/5726#issuecomment-4139214648\",\n32:       \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n33:     },\n34:     {\n35:       \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach8726OLV\",\n36:       \"author\": {\n37:         \"login\": \"katiermullen\"\n38:       },\n39:       \"authorAssociation\": \"MEMBER\",\n40:       \"body\": \"## Implementation Plan\\n\\n### Data source\\n- VeNom release h (Feb 2026), TermSubset sheet, Diagnosis subset\\n- 5,271 active diagnosis terms after filtering\\n- VeNom uses British English spelling; matching applies British-to-American conversion\\n- VeNom uses prefix `VeNom` (consistent with VBO), xref source is `MONDO:VeNom`\\n\\n### Phase 1: Data extraction (complete)\\n- Extracted VeNom Diagnosis terms to `data/venom_diagnosis_terms.tsv`\\n- Parsed parenthetical content into abbreviations, species qualifiers, and synonyms\\n- Extracted VeNom hierarchy from Relationship sheet\\n\\n### Phase 2: Matching VeNom → Mondo (complete)\\n- Full results in `data/venom_matching_results.tsv`\\n- Matching approach: normalized names, British-to-American spelling, VeNom \\\"X - Y\\\" subtype reversal, parenthetical synonym swaps\\n\\n| Category | Count | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| NHA exact match | 195 | VeNom term already exists in Mondo non-human animal branch |\\n| Human analog found | 991 | No NHA term, but matching human/general disease exists |\\n| No match | 4,085 | No name/synonym match in Mondo |\\n\\n- 174 unique Mondo NHA terms matched (some have multiple VeNom xrefs due to VeNom duplicates/variants)\\n- 16 false positives identified and reclassified, including:\\n  - Subtype concepts that over-matched to generic parents (e.g., \\\"Cachexia - cancer\\\" ≠ cancer)\\n  - Clinical severity grades that are distinct from the base concept (PLE CCECAI scores)\\n  - Concepts that matched via synonym but are different diseases (e.g., \\\"Cataract - Morgagnian\\\" ≠ CPAMD8-related cataract)\\n  - Concepts where the VeNom term is a synonym but not an exact match (e.g., \\\"Spiking mortality syndrome\\\" ≠ poult enteritis mortality syndrome; \\\"Osteochondrosis (Juvenile osteochondritis, dyschondroplasia)\\\" has additional scope)\\n\\n### Phase 3: Three separate ROBOT templates\\n\\n#### Template 1: NHA exact matches — add xrefs and synonyms (complete)\\n- File: `data/ROBOT_add_venom_xrefs_nha_matches.tsv`... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n41:       \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-27T13:06:36Z\",\n42:       \"includesCreatedEdit\": false,\n43:       \"isMinimized\": false,\n44:       \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n45:       \"reactionGroups\": [\n46:         {\n47:           \"content\": \"ROCKET\",\n48:           \"users\": {\n49:             \"totalCount\": 1\n50:           }\n51:         }\n52:       ],\n53:       \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/5726#issuecomment-4142457557\",\n54:       \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n55:     },\n56:     {\n57:       \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach8773Fkg\",\n58:       \"author\": {\n59:         \"login\": \"katiermullen\"\n60:       },\n61:       \"authorAssociation\": \"MEMBER\",\n62:       \"body\": \"Updated NHA exact matches to 231. \\n\\nPlan to proceed with venom alignment and address exact synonyms later because this requires a plan to: \\n\\n- name each exact synonym with a non-human animal specific name, or\\n- allow the same exact synonyms to be present in the human and NHA branches (e.g., hemophilia B, non human animal\\\" and \\\"hemophilia B\\\" would have the same exact synonym factor IX deficiency. \\n- Consider human and non-human subsets to accomplish this and allowing the same exact synonyms across the two subsets but not within each subset or a source annotation on NHA exact synonyms that would be MONDO:NonHumanAnimalDisease, or the like.\",\n63:       \"createdAt\": \"2026-04-10T17:23:02Z\",\n64:       \"includesCreatedEdit\": false,\n65:       \"isMinimized\": false,\n66:       \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n67:       \"reactionGroups\": [],\n68:       \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/5726#issuecomment-4225521952\",\n69:       \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n70:     },\n71:     {\n72:       \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach8773T9d\",\n73:       \"author\": {\n74:         \"login\": \"katiermullen\"\n75:       },\n76:       \"authorAssociation\": \"MEMBER\",\n77:       \"body\": \"Updated implementation plan up to template 1:\\n\\n## Implementation Plan\\n\\n### Data source\\n- VeNom release h (Feb 2026), TermSubset sheet, Diagnosis subset\\n- 6,372 Diagnosis terms total; 1,101 are inactive (Active=0), leaving 5,271 active diagnosis terms\\n- Inactive terms are deprecated VeNom codes superseded by newer active codes (e.g., VeNom:79859 → VeNom:81176 for \\\"Melanoma - guttural pouch\\\")\\n- All 5,271 active terms have unique term names (no duplicate labels among active terms)\\n- VeNom uses British English spelling; matching applies British-to-American conversion\\n- VeNom uses prefix `VeNom` (consistent with VBO), xref source is `MONDO:equivalentTo`\\n- Animal type subsets from the Terms sheet (Large animal, Small animal, Farm, Exotics, Equine, Avian) are added as `in_subset` annotations with the VeNom ID as source\\n- Subset definitions required in mondo-edit.obo header: `venom_large_animal`, `venom_small_animal`, `venom_farm_animal`, `venom_exotics`, `venom_equine`, `venom_avian`\\n- GitHub issue: https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/5726\\n\\n### Phase 1: Data extraction (complete)\\n- Extracted VeNom Diagnosis terms to `data/venom_diagnosis_terms.tsv`\\n- Parsed parenthetical content into abbreviations, species qualifiers, and synonyms\\n- Extracted VeNom hierarchy from Relationship sheet\\n\\n### Phase 2: Matching VeNom → Mondo (complete)\\n- Full results in `data/venom_matching_results.tsv`\\n- Matching approach: normalized names, British-to-American spelling, VeNom \\\"X - Y\\\" subtype reversal, parenthetical synonym swaps\\n\\n| Category | Count | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| NHA exact match | 195 | VeNom term already exists in Mondo non-human animal branch |\\n| Human analog found | 991 | No NHA term, but matching human/general disease exists |\\n| No match | 4,085 | No name/synonym match in Mondo |\\n\\n- 174 unique Mondo NHA terms matched (some have multiple VeNom xrefs due to VeNom duplicates/variants)\\n- 16 false positives identifi... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n78:       \"createdAt\": \"2026-04-10T17:33:35Z\",\n79:       \"includesCreatedEdit\": true,\n80:       \"isMinimized\": false,\n81:       \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n82:       \"reactionGroups\": [],\n83:       \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/5726#issuecomment-4225580893\",\n84:       \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n85:     },\n86:     {\n87:       \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach879HQJU\",\n88:       \"author\": {\n89:         \"login\": \"katiermullen\"\n90:       },\n91:       \"authorAssociation\": \"MEMBER\",\n92:       \"body\": \"#### Template 2: Human analog matches — new NHA terms via cross-species analog pattern (v2 → curated v2)\\n- Original file: `data/ROBOT_add_venom_xrefs_human_analogs.tsv` (587 rows)\\n- Intermediate file: `data/ROBOT_add_venom_xrefs_human_analogs_v2.tsv` (811 data rows)\\n- Curated source of truth: `data/curated_ROBOT_add_venom_xrefs_human_analogs_v2.tsv` (**728 data rows**)\\n- Creates new NHA terms with cross-species analog matches\\n- New terms follow `nonhuman_disease.yaml` pattern: \\\"{human disease}, non-human animal\\\"\\n- Definition: \\\"{human disease} that occurs in non-human animals.\\\" with xref `MONDO:patterns/nonhuman_disease`\\n- Logical definition: `EquivalentTo MONDO:0005583 and (MONDO:0700097 some {human analog})`\\n- Each gets: VeNom xref (`MONDO:equivalentTo`), VeNom name as synonym where it differs, abbreviation synonyms\\n- Includes `in_subset` annotations (6 animal type subsets) and `term_tracker_item`\\n- New MONDO IDs: MONDO:1013000 – MONDO:1013793\\n- v2 changes:\\n  - 40 rows removed (moved to Template 1 — NHA terms already existed)\\n  - 166 rows added from the 404 no-match file — valid single-word exact matches that were incorrectly excluded by the original matching (e.g., \\\"Acne\\\" → acne, \\\"Botulism\\\" → botulism, \\\"Rabies\\\" → rabies, \\\"Tetanus\\\" → tetanus)\\n  - 67 rows added from Template 3 candidates — \\\"unspecified\\\" qualifier terms that map directly to the base disease human analog (e.g., \\\"Gastritis (unspecified)\\\" → gastritis, \\\"Cholesteatoma (site unspecified)\\\" → cholesteatoma). These are not subtypes — the \\\"(unspecified)\\\" qualifier means the VeNom term IS the base disease.\\n  - 9 human analog corrections (e.g., \\\"familial hyperlipidemia\\\" → \\\"hyperlipidemia\\\", \\\"adult teratoma\\\" → \\\"teratoma\\\", \\\"skin neoplasm\\\" → \\\"abscess\\\" for Abscess-skin)\\n  - 1 additional correction: \\\"Nephroblastoma (site unspecified)\\\" now maps to MONDO:0006058 \\\"Wilms tumor\\\" (generic) instead of MONDO:0008679 \\\"Wilms tumor 1\\\" (specific)\\n- v3 changes (... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n93:       \"createdAt\": \"2026-04-14T19:20:36Z\",\n94:       \"includesCreatedEdit\": false,\n95:       \"isMinimized\": false,\n96:       \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n97:       \"reactionGroups\": [],\n98:       \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/5726#issuecomment-4246536788\",\n99:       \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n100:     }\n101:   ],\n102:   \"title\": \"Add non-human animal diseases from VeNom\",\n103:   \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/5726\"\n104: }\n\n(End of file - total 104 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"body\": \"This is a self-assigned issue I am opening to add non-human animal diseases from VeNom. \\r\\n\\r\\nSee https://venomcoding.org/venom-codes/\\r\\n\\r\\nThere are 6,182 rows of diagnosis data with disease/phenotype name, VeNom code, body system classification (if applicable), and group of animal affected (large animal, small animal, farm animal, equine, exotics). \\r\\n\\r\\nThis data will need curation as some \\\"diagnoses\\\" are actually \\\"phenotypes\\\" and should be added to uPheno. \\r\\n\\r\\nThe non-human animal diseases will be mapped to human disease analogs as appropriate. \",\n  \"comments\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach85TUWn4\",\n      \"author\": {\n        \"login\": \"nicolevasilevsky\"\n      },\n      \"authorAssociation\": \"MEMBER\",\n      \"body\": \"@katiermullen could you assign this to a milestone? (You can always push it back later)\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2023-01-20T02:16:22Z\",\n      \"includesCreatedEdit\": true,\n      \"isMinimized\": false,\n      \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n      \"reactionGroups\": [],\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/5726#issuecomment-1397844472\",\n      \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach872t2c4\",","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"__issue_context__.json","time":{"start":1778533279210,"end":1778533279222}},"id":"prt_e18d81b0b001T5e1Ajw1FqNRY0","sessionID":"ses_1e72c9a66ffepiGuNQMZw6iNCY","messageID":"msg_e18d3666c001DEH7PdnmL2b7h0"}}
